":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、短稱或官稱指代待核；不補造姓名或自動合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0244","start":244,"end":246,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0281","start":281,"end":282,"surface":"豹","kind":"person","person_id":"rlv_clg_euu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p040","text":"三十五年夏，會諸侯于葵丘。周襄王使宰孔賜桓公文武胙、彤弓矢、大路，命無拜。桓公欲許之，管仲曰「不可」，乃下拜受賜。秋，復會諸侯於葵丘，益有驕色。周使宰孔會。諸侯頗有叛者。晉侯病，後，遇宰孔。宰孔曰：「齊侯驕矣，弟無行。」從之。是歲，晉獻公卒，裏克殺奚齊、卓子，秦穆公以夫人入公子夷吾為晉君。桓公於是討晉亂，至高梁，使隰朋立晉君，還。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"周襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"gt1_z7d_s3u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"宰孔","kind":"person","person_id":"ho5_sbj_e9x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"文武","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"h1v_8ap_b9y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"宰孔","kind":"person","person_id":"ho5_sbj_e9x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m040-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"