。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p051","text":"九年，晉裏克殺其君奚齊、卓子。齊桓公率釐公討晉亂，至髙梁而還，立晉惠公。十七年，齊桓公卒。二十四年，晉文公即位。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"uon_qea_38x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"卓子","kind":"person","person_id":"dkc_j4z_klk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"晉惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"a9v_t0d_3va","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m051-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p037","text":"驪姬弟生悼子。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m037-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"驪姬弟","kind":"person","person_id":"wds_1r8_9kx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m037-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"悼子","kind":"person","person_id":"dkc_j4z_klk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p038","text":"二十六年夏，齊桓公大會諸侯於葵丘。晉獻公病，行後，未至，逢周之宰孔。宰孔曰：「齊桓公益驕，不務德而務遠略，諸侯弗平。君弟毋會，毋如晉何。」獻公亦病，復還歸。病甚，乃謂荀息曰：「吾以奚齊爲後，年少，諸大臣不服，恐亂起，子能立之乎？」荀息曰：「能。」獻公曰：「何以爲驗？」對曰：「使死者復生，生者不慚，爲之驗。」於是遂屬奚齊於荀息。荀息爲相，主國政。秋九月，獻公卒。裏克、邳鄭欲内重耳，以三公子之徒作亂，謂荀息曰：「三怨將起，秦、晉輔之，子將何如？」荀息曰：「吾不可負先君言。」十月，裏克殺奚齊于喪次，獻公未葬也。荀息將死之，或曰不如立奚齊弟悼子而傅之，荀息立悼子而葬獻公。十一月，裏克弒悼子于朝，荀息死之。君子曰：「詩所謂『白珪之玷，猶可磨也，斯言之玷，不可爲也』，其荀息之謂乎！不負其言。」初，獻公將伐驪戎，卜曰「齒牙爲禍」。及破驪戎，獲驪姬，愛之，竟以亂晉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"晉獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0029","start":29,"end":33,"surface":"周之宰孔","kind":"person","person_id":"svx_710_4bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"宰孔","kind":"person","person_id":"svx_710_4bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"g14_wpb_odv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"g14_wpb_odv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m038-0123","start":123,"end":125